  },
  {
    field: 'Biotechnology / Life Sciences / Microbiology',
    outcomes:
      'Splits between a PhD-and-research track (CSIR-NET Life Sciences, university labs, biotech company R&D) and an industry-execution track — QC/QA in pharma manufacturing, clinical research coordination, regulatory affairs, or medical writing. The industry-execution track hires faster and pays sooner than the pure-research track.',
