    mba: 'Broad, cross-functional business literacy — finance, marketing, operations, strategy — applied to running or growing an organisation',
  },
  {
    factor: 'Default next step after the degree',
    msc: 'PhD (if research-inclined), a lab or technical role, or a subject-specific industry function like QC, regulatory, or clinical research',
    mba: 'A management, business analyst, consulting, sales, or general-management role, usually in a company you did not already work at',
  },
  {
    factor: 'Entry requirement and selection filter',
    msc: 'Bachelor\'s degree in a related science subject; entry is largely academic, not competitive-exam gated at the master\'s stage itself',
