  {
    num: '02',
    title: 'Choosing MBA mainly because MSc salaries look slower to climb',
    body: 'Entry-level MSc pay in India commonly starts around Rs 3-8 lakh a year, which does look slower than a strong MBA outcome. But comparing a fresh MSc salary to a post-MBA salary ignores that the MBA also cost two years of tuition and lost income, and that MSc-linked government and PSU roles carry stability an MBA route rarely matches at entry level.',
  },
  {
    num: '03',
